ttings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 12px; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;Backend сервисы:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;1. Система управления пользователями -&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;отвечает за авторизацию, регистрацию и редактирования информации о пользователях.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333333&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Система управления заказами - &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;отвечает за управление заказами.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Система управления товарами -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;отвечает за управление товарами&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Система управления услугами -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;отвечает за управление услугами.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;5.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Система управления аукционами&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt; -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;отвечает за управление аукционами.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;6.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Система управления апелляциями&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt; -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;отвечает за управление апелляциями, взаимодействует как с клиентами, так и с администратором (скорее всего аукционы и апелляции надо было объединить).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;7.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Система управления заявками техподдержки&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;отвечает за управление заявками техподдержки.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;8.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Система управления платежами&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;отвечает за управление платежами, взаимодействует с платежными системами и брокером сообщений.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;9.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Система управления отчетности&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;отвечает за построение отчетности для внутренних сотрудников компании.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;10.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Система отправки уведомлений&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;отвечает за отправку уведомлений как внешним, так и внутренним пользователям.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Взаимодействие между сервисами происходит синхронно и асинхронно. Обработка платежей и уведомления пользователей асинхронные.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=15;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3256" y="3034" width="904" height="873" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
